# Analyst Role (Mid-Level SEO Specialist)

## Responsibilities
• Manage $15k - $40k in monthly client accounts
• Conduct comprehensive technical audits (Core Web Vitals, crawlability, indexing)
• Implement structured data (JSON-LD, Schema.org)
• Advanced Google Analytics 4 configuration (events, conversions, segments)
• GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) strategy and implementation
• AI-assisted content strategy and optimization
• Link evaluation, acquisition, and remediation
• Page speed optimization (LCP, FID, CLS)
• Client strategy calls and monthly reporting
• Campaign strategy for national brands and e-commerce

## Required Skills
• Technical SEO expertise (crawl budget, rendering, JavaScript SEO)
• Core Web Vitals optimization
• Advanced keyword research and competitive analysis
• Google Search Console advanced features
• HTML/CSS/JavaScript understanding
• Server configuration basics (htaccess, redirects, canonicals)
• Structured data implementation (JSON-LD, microdata)
• Understanding of LLMs and AI search (ChatGPT, Perplexity, SGE)
• Link quality assessment and risk evaluation
• Client communication and expectation management

## Advanced Capabilities
• GEO optimization for AI search engines
• Site migration planning and execution
• International SEO (hreflang, geo-targeting)
• E-commerce SEO strategy
• Content cluster architecture
• Penalty diagnosis and recovery
• Competitive technical analysis
• Python/API basics for automation
• Prompt engineering for AI content tools

## Tools Proficiency
• Screaming Frog, Sitebulb, or similar crawlers
• Google Search Console & Analytics 4
• Ahrefs, SEMrush, or similar platforms
• PageSpeed Insights / Lighthouse
• Tag Manager (GTM)
• AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity)
• Basic SQL for data analysis
